# Native projects are GENERATED, not committed (Expo CNG — `expo prebuild`
# recreates ios/ and android/ from app.json + config plugins). These previously
# only ignored the build OUTPUT inside them, so anyone running prebuild locally
# got a few thousand untracked files staring at them.
app-mobile/ios/
app-mobile/android/

# OS
.DS_Store
.gstack/
